{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44471","headline":"诗三百三首 一六八 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 一六八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒山有一宅，宅中无阑隔。\n六门左右通，堂中见天碧。\n房房虚索索，东壁打西壁。\n其中一物无，免被人来惜。\n寒到烧輭火，饥来煮菜吃。\n不学田舍翁，广置牛庄宅。\n尽作地狱业，一入何曾极。\n好好善思量，思量知轨则。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}